<title>USA: National Medical Care gets subpoena.</title>
<headline>National Medical Care gets subpoena.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Medical Care said Tuesday it received an investigatory subpoena from the U.S. Department of Health and Human Resources on Oct. 31, calling for documents related to a Medicare investigation.</p>
<p>A statement from National Medical said the U.S. Attorney for the Eastern district of Pennsylvania is investigating the possible submission of false or improper claims to and their payment by the Medicare program.</p>
<p>National Medical is a subsidiary of Fresenius Medical Care.</p>
